              "type": "text",
              "text": "The HCF of two numbers is 15, and the LCM is 420. Find the two numbers.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "There are two possible pairs.",
              "marks": []
